escribes a test case in the form of a single string, .  Constraints  All characters are lowercase English letters. Output Format  Print an integer denoting the zero-indexed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":229507,"global_rank":113678},{"name":"Jon-S-Hall/FrameCast","owner":"Jon-S-Hall","html_url":"https://github.com/Jon-S-Hall/FrameCast","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Project Stuff from a projector onto a wall. ","topics":[],"score":229504,"global_rank":113685},{"name":"3miumi/pdfChatbot_new","owner":"3miumi","html_url":"https://github.com/3miumi/pdfChatbot_new","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229504,"global_rank":113689},{"name":"3miumi/pdfchatbot","owner":"3miumi","html_url":"https://github.com/3miumi/pdfchatbot","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229504,"global_rank":113690},{"name":"varuntej07/Bidirectional-Maze-Search","owner":"varuntej07","html_url":"https://github.com/varuntej07/Bidirectional-Maze-Search","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Solve mazes using Bidirectional BFS, starting from both the entrance (top-left) and exit (bottom-right). Takes a matrix text file (0 = path, 1 = wall) as input and outputs the solved maze with 2 marking the disc